Test result: `uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"` →
5845 passed, 304 skipped, 6 deselected, 1 xfailed in ~48s. MCP-scoped subset
(`tests/units/mcp tests/mcp`) → 104 passed. Entry points verified: `server.app`
imports cleanly, `combined_app` is a FastAPI instance, `create_mcp_server`
returns a FastMCP instance, and the standalone `mcp_server.py` script imports.
